  "Description": {
    "Cost": 4485016,
    "UIName": "Celerity",
    "Id": "chassisdef_celerity_CLR-03-OE",
    "Name": "Celerity",
    "Details": "The E loadout of the Republic's CLR-03-O OmniMech variant carries an ER medium laser and an improved heavy medium laser, both built to Clan specifications. A rocket launcher with 10 shots is also mounted for some extra firepower when needed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Quad Mech (Squad)</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.94</color></b>",
